// =============================================================================
// Chora Content Sharing Service (gRPC)
// =============================================================================
//
// Source-of-truth: docs/chora-sharing.md §5 (greenfield build spec).
//
// Inter-service gRPC contract for the Content Sharing core domain
// (chora_sharing database, Team 1 / Content). Surface: C+ Connect+
// (tagline: "curiosity meets connection").
//
// Aggregates exposed:
//   - Follow              — directional social graph edge (follower -> followee)
//   - Post                — atomic-feedback post in the social feed
//   - Reaction            — like / clap / star reaction on a Post
//   - Leaderboard         — ranked aggregate per scope + season
//   - AtomUsageGrant      — licensing record (the new aggregate root)
//   - RoyaltySettlement   — double-entry royalty accrual
//
// Atom-centric: an author shares a LearningAtom (owned by chora-creation)
// to the social feed under a per-atom license; other learners grant the
// right to reuse it in duels / test-sets / LiveQuizzes / collections;
// royalty settles at the point of reuse; a leaderboard ranks the resulting
// activity.
//
// R1 (author stays the original): only the atom's owner may share it.
// R2 (author decides licensing per atom): LicenseTerms governs reuse
// everywhere; frozen at grant time onto each AtomUsageGrant.
//
// Cross-DB queries FORBIDDEN — atom_ids are cross-domain UUIDs from
// chora_creation; learner profile data is consumed via Pub/Sub-fed
// projections.
//
// Deployed in chora-content (Team 1 pool). mTLS via the service mesh;
// SPIFFE identity in mesh; W3C trace context in gRPC metadata.
// =============================================================================

